# [PCE](../wg/pce.html)

## Summary

The Path Computation Element (PCE) Working Group met at IETF 127 in San Francisco. The session covered working group administration, status updates on active drafts, and technical presentations on auto-bandwidth updates, BFD parameter extensions, LSP validation, Network Resource Partitions (NRP), PCEP over QUIC, fine-granularity transport networks, implicit TLS, SRv6 SID list optimization, and per-path metric signaling.

Two working group documents (`draft-ietf-pce-stateful-pce-autobw-update` and `draft-ietf-pce-pcep-bfd-parameters`) were declared ready for Working Group Last Call (WGLC) following minor list resolutions.

