### PCEP Extensions to Support BFD Parameters
**Presenter**: Marina Koldobsky  
**Slides**: [2.2 PCEP extensions to support BFD parameters](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-pce-22-pcep-extensions-to-support-bfd-parameters-02)  
**Draft**: `draft-ietf-pce-pcep-bfd-parameters`

* **Updates**: Added traffic type flag bits (e.g., RSVP-TE, SR-MPLS, SRv6) to the SBFD capability to account for PCEs supporting multiple traffic types simultaneously.
* **Discussion**: Andrew Stone asked if any BFD parameters were missing. Marina Koldobsky confirmed the current set adequately covers required BFD group parameters.
* **Outcome**: Ready to proceed to Working Group Last Call.

