### PCEP Extensions for Network Resource Partition (NRP)
**Presenter**: Jia He  
**Slides**: [3.1 PCEP Extension for NRP](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-pce-31-pcep-extension-for-nrp-01)  
**Draft**: `draft-ietf-pce-pcep-nrp`

* **WG Draft Updates**: Added references to SPRING NRP policy, clarified path computation rules (paths must strictly use nodes/links participating in the NRP), and defined behaviors when NRP TLVs or capabilities are omitted or removed.
* **Individual PCECC Draft**: Jia He presented a companion individual draft proposing PCE Centralized Controller (PCECC) extensions to instantiate NRP resource reservations on underlying network devices.
* **Discussion**: Dhruv Dhody suggested evaluating whether using PCECC for link-level NRP resource reservation is architecturally desirable before diving into detailed object encodings.

