### Implicit TLS Profile for PCEP
**Presenter**: Samuel Sidor  
**Slides**: [3.4 Implicit TLS Profile for PCEP](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-pce-34-implicit-tls-profile-for-pcep-00)

* **Overview**: Proposes starting the TLS handshake immediately upon TCP connection establishment without StartTLS negotiation for strictly managed, TLS-mandatory environments.
* **Discussion**: Dhruv Dhody questioned operational difficulty claims regarding separate port assignments and recommended reviewing security and Area guidance on implicit TLS versus StartTLS.

