### SRv6 Policy SID List Optimization
**Presenter**: Samuel Sidor  
**Slides**: [4.1 SRv6 Policy SID List Optimization](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-pce-42-srv6-policy-sid-list-optimization-00)

* **Overview**: Companion PCEP extensions to SPRING SRv6 SID list optimization, defining signaling to omit redundant back-to-back endpoint SIDs at the end of a SID list.
* **Discussion**: Comments raised questions regarding how the controller determines service vs. transport SID contexts and suggested clarifying ingress node behavior when removing the final SID.

