### Signaling Per-Path Metric
**Presenter**: Samuel Sidor  
**Slides**: [4.3 Signaling Per-Path Metric](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-pce-44-signaling-per-path-metric-00)

* **Overview**: Defines PCEP signaling to carry metrics per candidate path / segment list rather than per LSP, supporting multipath LSPs and alignment with BGP-LS.
* **Discussion**: Due to session time limits, discussion was cut short and directed to the mailing list.

